  <data name="txtBox.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This program allows you to install Factory Manager and its supporting softwares on your system.

It is strongly recommended that before proceeding, you ensure that no other Windows programs are running. After Installation this computer will restart.

If you do not wish to install Factory Manager, click 'Exit' now, else click 'Next' to continue.
